  "title": "Beetroot",
  "handle": "beetroot",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>Beetroot Capsules</strong> provide a convenient, natural way to support your body’s nitric oxide production and healthy blood circulation. Nitric oxide plays an important role in supporting normal blood circulation, healthy blood pressure, and efficient oxygen delivery to active muscles. This makes Beetroot Capsules an ideal companion for those with an active lifestyle or anyone looking to support cardiovascular wellness. </p><p></p><p>Beetroot contains naturally occurring compounds that may help enhance endurance and stamina during physical activity. By supporting healthy blood flow and oxygen supply, these capsules help your muscles perform more efficiently, making them suitable for both casual exercisers and competitive athletes. </p><p></p><p>Formulated with pure beetroot powder in a vegetarian capsule, this supplement is simple, clean, and easy to integrate into your daily routine. Beetroot Capsules offer a natural, plant-based way to support your energy, blood circulation, and overall physical performance*</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredients:</strong> Organic Beetroot Powder (beta vulgaris) 1300mg, Hypromellose (vegetable capsule), Microcrystalline Cellulose, Magnesium Stearate.</p><p><strong>Manufacturer Country:</strong> USA</p><p><strong>Product Amount:</strong> 60 capsules</p><p><strong>Gross Weight:</strong> 2.6 oz / 0.16 lb / 73 g</p><p><strong>Suggested Use: </strong>Take two (2) capsules once a day as a dietary supplement. For best results, take 20-30 min before a meal with an 8oz (237 ml) glass of water or as directed by your healthcare professional.</p><p><strong>Caution:</strong> Do not exceed recommended dose. Pregnant or nursing mothers, children under the age of 18, and individuals with a known medical condition should consult a physician before using this or any dietary supplement.</p><p><strong>Warning:</strong> Keep out of reach of children. Do not use if the safety seal is damaged or missing. Store in a cool, dry place.</p><p><br></p><p>*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p> <p>\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/4c36cdfa54b26cb4291c359dc2cd7910d868f8ae-125x181.png\" alt=\"Gluten-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/2390692fa16a1bad9ae4453609bcd8b61afbb0b2-149x180.png\" alt=\"Vegetarian\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/cc4066d915d42e195ee9cf5bbce01a99f006af1e-126x181.png\" alt=\"Lactose-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/f7e562d6bb212503da89f944a0d799171e6d48fe-125x181.png\" alt=\"Allergen-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/e2132e2f64f15727e375c7aa509fedd7bdcf1ae8-126x182.png\" alt=\"Hormone-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/f99540cc3d3f192a68004f4518d57b0cd7c27aa7-125x181.png\" alt=\"Antibiotic-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/a007d72855c1d7a309b8b6dec5eadf939bb8a80d-125x181.png\" alt=\"Corn-free\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/g0smbdlu/production/392fe7a0ceded284f4aeb9c2eeb40c638917d6be-149x180.png\" alt=\"Vegan friendly\" style=\"height: 6rem; width: auto;\"></p>",
